      "text": "[2:11PM] #Apapa #TrafficUpdate \n\nNagaff junction down to Airways towards Flour mills is good to go. \n\nFlour mills inward Eleganza roundabout down to Etisalat towards Mr Biggs is also in good shape.\n\nReturn journey from Mr Biggs to Etisalat towards Eleganza is also in order.\n\nEleganza towards Port gate axis is very busy due to activities within the port axis but our officers are managing the traffic effectively on the corridor.\n\nReturn journey from Port gate down to Eleganza towards Airways is good to go.\n\nApproaching Area B connecting Leventis bridge outward Apapa is also in good shape.\n\n#followLASTMA",
